  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n ((x+3)³+(x-3)³)/(x²+27)\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n(a + b)³ = a³ + b³ + 3ab ( a + b )\n\n(a - b)3 = a3 - b3 - 3ab ( a - b )\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nAccording to the question,\n\nThe expression is = ((x+3)³+(x-3)³)/(x²+27)\n\nWe know,\n\n( x + 3)³ = x³ + 3³ + 3 × (x) × 3 (x + 3)\n\n⇒ ( x + 3)³ = x³ + 27 + 9x(x + 3)\n\n⇒( x + 3)³ = x3 + 27 + 9x² + 27x\n\n⇒( x + 3)3 = x3 + 9x2 + 27x + 27 ---------(1)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n( x - 3)3 = x3 - 33 - 3 × (x) × 3 (x - 3)\n\n⇒ (x - 3)³ = x3 - 27 - 9x(x - 3)\n\n⇒( x - 3)3 = x3 - 27 - 9x2 + 27x\n\n⇒( x - 3)³ = x3 - 9x2 + 27x - 27 ---------(2)\n\nPut the value of eq. (1) and eq. (2) in given expression\n\n⇒ ((x+3)³+(x-3)³)/(x²+27) = ( (x³ + 9x² + 27x + 27) + (x³ - 9x² + 27x - 27) )/(x² + 27)\n\n⇒ ((x+3)³+(x-3)³)/(x²+27) = (2x³ +54x)/(x² + 27)\n\n⇒ ((x+3)³+(x-3)³)/(x²+27) = (2x(x²+27))/(x²+27)\n\n⇒ ((x+3)³+(x-3)³)/(x²+27) = 2x\n\n \n\n**∴ The value of ((x+3)³+(x-3)³)/(x²+27) is 2x.**",
